{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "RC Overdrive",
    "steam_appid": 2777660,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RC Overdrive</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 championships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >stunt arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arcade mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 20 tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 different RC-Cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RC-Car Customizing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 levels of player progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different AI difficulties </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different levels of simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 30 RC cars, utilize their parts to build and customize your own RC car, adjusting its performance characteristics such as acceleration, suspension types, tire grip, and visual appearance including body and antenna customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tracks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a track master by maintaining high speeds without flipping your car as you navigate through diverse environments including malls, suburban streets, miniature worlds, museums, RC tracks, and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Championships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through six championships, aiming to finish at least third place in each race to progress, earning money for new cars and XP to level up and unlock more challenging championships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In RC Overdrive, there are 20 levels to unlock cars and parts for your custom RC car, achieved by competing in races where finishing in first place earns you the most XP to progress to new levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success in RC Overdrive hinges on strategic item usage, with access to 8 unique items such as drones with bombs, oil spills, turbo boosts, and others, all aimed at securing your first-place position through tactical maneuvers during races.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RC Overdrive</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 championships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >stunt arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arcade mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 20 tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 different RC-Cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RC-Car Customizing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 levels of player progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different AI difficulties </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different levels of simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 30 RC cars, utilize their parts to build and customize your own RC car, adjusting its performance characteristics such as acceleration, suspension types, tire grip, and visual appearance including body and antenna customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tracks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a track master by maintaining high speeds without flipping your car as you navigate through diverse environments including malls, suburban streets, miniature worlds, museums, RC tracks, and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Championships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through six championships, aiming to finish at least third place in each race to progress, earning money for new cars and XP to level up and unlock more challenging championships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In RC Overdrive, there are 20 levels to unlock cars and parts for your custom RC car, achieved by competing in races where finishing in first place earns you the most XP to progress to new levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success in RC Overdrive hinges on strategic item usage, with access to 8 unique items such as drones with bombs, oil spills, turbo boosts, and others, all aimed at securing your first-place position through tactical maneuvers during races.</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into the exciting world of remote-controlled car racing with RC Overdrive, where strategy, precision, and speed come together for an electrifying and thrilling experience!",
